      "releaseNotes": "We're frequently updating Fubo to give you the best experience. Turn on auto updates to ensure you always have the latest version. This update includes:\n[+] New short-form player for sports highlights\n[+] Live previews on the Home Page\n[+] Follow your favorite leagues and teams\n[+] Updated Sports page",
